        <mxCell id="wluvppmajmwT7S5br0mU-0" parent="e1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" value="Comments:&lt;br&gt;there should be an edit togele, that slices the visual geometry.&lt;br&gt;it still shows the geometry in the midles, but everything but the slice is now see through. A slider, or number setter allows to select the slice. To the left, one can set the matrix numbers for that slice&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Fictional observation can be selected and i either empty or can take a numpy object, tf, json object for fillig&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Action scores shows all actions in sequential order, but each of them has the green bar showing how right the actions where&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
